ros para reintentarlo."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Feed paused after repeated loading failures. Reopen or change filters to retry."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Feedet er sat på pause efter gentagne indlæsningsfejl. Åbn igen, eller skift filtre for at prøve igen."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Flux en pause après des échecs de chargement répétés. Rouvrez-le ou modifiez les filtres pour réessayer."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Feed gepauzeerd na herhaalde laadfouten. Open opnieuw of wijzig de filters om het nog eens te proberen."}}}},"hint_files_container_cant_be_read":{"localizations":{"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Il contenitore del file non può essere letto su questo dispositivo."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"The file's container can't be read on this device."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"El contenedor del archivo no se puede leer en este dispositivo."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"O contêiner do arquivo não pode ser lido neste dispositivo."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Le conteneur du fichier ne peut pas être lu sur cet appareil."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Контейнер файла не может быть прочитан на этом устройстве."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Der Container der Datei kann auf diesem Gerät nicht gelesen werden."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"このファイルのコンテナはこのデバイスでは読み込めません。"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Kontenera tego pliku nie można odczytać na tym urządzeniu."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"이 기기에서 파일의 컨테이너를 읽을 수 없습니다."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"De container van het bestand kan op dit apparaat niet worden gelezen."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"تتعذّر قراءة حاوية الملف على