* + ^ ` | ~"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"I nomi degli header possono contenere solo lettere, cifre e - _ . ! # $ %% & ' * + ^ ` | ~"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Nomes de cabeçalho só podem conter letras, dígitos e - _ . ! # $ %% & ' * + ^ ` | ~"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"标头名称只能包含字母、数字和 - _ . ! # $ %% & ' * + ^ ` | ~"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Headernamn får bara innehålla bokstäver, siffror och - _ . ! # $ %% & ' * + ^ ` | ~"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Başlık adları yalnızca harf, rakam ve - _ . ! # $ %% & ' * + ^ ` | ~ içerebilir"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"標頭名稱只能包含字母、數字及 - _ . ! # $ %% & ' * + ^ ` | ~"}}}},"hint_hidden_never_shows_it_above":{"localizations":{"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Dold visar det aldrig. Över 1× ger också nya scener."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"“隐藏”表示永不显示。高于 1× 还会带来新的短片。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"「已隱藏」表示永不顯示。高於 1× 時也會帶來新短片。"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Gizli, onu hiç göstermez. 1× üzeri yeni sahneler de getirir."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ukryte nigdy się nie pojawia. Powyżej 1× przynosi też nowe sceny."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"«مخفي» لا يعرضه أبدًا. ما فوق 1× يجلب أيضًا مشاهد جديدة."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Skjult viser det aldrig. Over 1× giver også nye scener."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Verborgen toont het nooit. Boven 1× komen er ook nieuwe scènes."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Oculto nunca o mostra. Acima de 1× também traz novas cenas."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Skjult viser den aldri. Over 1× gir også nye scener."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"«Скрыто» — никогда не показывать. Выше 1× — также приносит новые сцены."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Nascosto non lo mostra mai. Sopra 1× porta anche nuove scene."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"가려짐으로 설정하면 표시되지 않습니다. 1×보다 높으면 새로운 영상도 가져옵니다."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ausgeblendet zeigt es nie. Über 1× bringt auch neue Szenen."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"「非表示」にすると表示されません。1×より上にすると新しいシーンも表示されます。"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Masqué ne l'affiche jamais. Au-delà de 1×, de nouvelles scènes sont aussi proposées."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Hidden never shows it. Above 1× also brings new scenes."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Oculto no lo muestra nunca. Por encima de 1× también trae escenas nuevas."}}}},"hint_hidden_never_shows_it_above_1":{"localizations":{"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Verborgen toont het nooit. Boven 1× komen er ook nieuwe scènes. Veeg om te verwijderen."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"가려짐으로 설정하면 표시되지 않습니다. 1×보다 높으면 새로운 영상도 가져옵니다. 쓸어넘겨 제거하세요."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ausgeblendet zeigt es nie. Über 1× bringt auch neue Szenen. Zum Entfernen wischen."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"「非表示」にすると表示されません。1×より上にすると新しいシーンも表示されます。スワイプで削除。"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"«Скрыто» — никогда не показывать. Выше 1× — также приносит новые сцены. Смахните, чтобы удалить."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Masqué ne l'affiche jamais. Au-delà de 1×, de nouvelles scènes sont aussi proposées. Balayez pour retirer."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ukryte nigdy się nie pojawia. Powyżej 1× przynosi też nowe sceny. Przesuń, aby usunąć."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Skjult viser det aldrig. Over 1× giver også nye scener. Stryg for at 