r ha restituito il codice di stato %@"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"ログインに失敗しました：サーバーがステータスコード%@を返しました"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Inloggningen misslyckades: servern returnerade statuskod %@"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Falha no login: o servidor retornou o código de status %@"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Login failed: Server returned status code %@"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Logowanie nie powiodło się: serwer zwrócił kod stanu %@"}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Innlogging mislyktes: Serveren returnerte statuskode %@"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Anmeldung fehlgeschlagen: Server antwortete mit Statuscode %@"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Échec de la connexion : le serveur a renvoyé le code d'état %@"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"فشل تسجيل الدخول: أعاد الخادم رمز الحالة %@"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Не удалось войти: сервер вернул код состояния %@"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"로그인 실패: 서버가 상태 코드 %@을(를) 반환했습니다"}}}},"hint_login_with_your_stash_credentials":{"localizations":{"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Logg inn med Stash-påloggingen din for å hente API-nøkkelen."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Inicia sesión con tus credenciales de Stash para obtener la clave de API."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Log ind med dine Stash-loginoplysninger for at hente API-nøglen."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"API 키를 가져오려면 Stash 자격 증명으로 로그인하세요."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Connectez-vous avec vos identifiants Stash pour récupérer la clé API."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Log in met je Stash-gegevens om de API-sleutel op te halen."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Login with your Stash credentials to retrieve the API key."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Faça login com suas credenciais do Stash para obter a chave de API."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Accedi con le tue credenziali Stash per ottenere la chiave API."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Melde dich mit deinen Stash-Zugangsdaten an, um den API-Schlüssel abzurufen."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"StashのログインIDとパスワードでログインして、APIキーを取得します。"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Войдите с учетными данными Stash, чтобы получить ключ API."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"سجّل الدخول ببيانات اعتماد Stash لاسترداد مفتاح API."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Zaloguj się danymi Stash, aby pobrać klucz API."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Logga in med dina Stash-uppgifter för att hämta API-nyckeln."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"使用你的 Stash 凭证登录以获取 API 密钥。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"使用你的 Stash 帳號密碼登入以取得 API 金鑰。"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"API anahtarını almak için Stash bilgilerinle giriş yap."}}}},"hint_love_spouse_2_4g_toys":{"localizations":{"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Love Spouse 2.4g-leksaker använder BLE-annonsering. Se till att Bluetooth är på och att leksaken är i parkopplings-/sökläge. Alla leksaker inom räckhåll reagerar samtidigt."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Love Spouse 2.4G 玩具使用 BLE 广播。请确保已开启蓝牙且玩具处于配对/扫描模式。范围内的所有玩具都会同时响应。"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Love Spouse 2.4g oyuncakları BLE yayını kullanır. Bluetooth'un açık ve oyuncağın eşleme/tarama modunda olduğundan emin ol. Menzildeki tüm oyuncaklar aynı anda tepki verir."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Love Spouse 2.4g 玩具使用 BLE 廣播。請確定藍牙已開啟，且玩具處於配對／掃描模式。範圍內的所有玩具會同時反應。"}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Love Spouse 2.4g-legetøj bruger BLE-annoncering. Sørg for, at Bluetooth er slået til, og at legetøjet er i parrings-/scanningstilstand. Alt legetøj inden for rækkevidde reagerer samtidigt."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Игрушки Love Spouse 2.4g используют рекламные пакеты BLE. Убедитесь, что Bluetooth включен, а игрушка находится в режиме сопряжения/поиска. Все игрушки в радиусе действия будут реагировать одновременно."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Love Spouse 2.4g 토이는 BLE 광고를 사용합니다. Bluetooth가 켜져 있고 토이가 페어링/스캔 모드인지 확인하세요. 범위 내의 토이 두 개가 동시에 반응합니다."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Love Spouse 2.4g-leketøy bruker BLE-annonsering. Sørg for at Bluetooth er slått på og at leketøyet er i paringsmodus/skannemodus. Alle leketøy innenfor rekkevidde reagerer samtidig."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Love Spouse 2.4G-speeltjes gebruiken BLE-advertising. Zorg dat Bluetooth aanstaat en het speeltje in koppel-/scanmodus staat. Alle speeltjes binnen bereik reageren tegelijk."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Love Spouse 2.4g toys use BLE advertising. Ensure Bluetooth is enabled and the toy is in pairing/scan mode. Both toys in range will react simultaneously."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"I giocattoli Love Spouse 2.4g usano l'advertising BLE. Assicurati che il Bluetooth sia attivo e che il giocattolo sia in modalità abbinamento/scansione. Tutti i giocattoli nel raggio d'azione reagiranno contemporaneamente."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Love Spouse 2.4gトイはBLEアドバタイズを使用します。Bluetoothがオンで、トイがペアリング/スキャンモードになっていることを確認してください。範囲内のすべてのトイが同時に反応します。"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"تستخدم ألعاب Love Spouse بتردد 2.4g الإعلان عبر BLE. تأكد من تفعيل Bluetooth وأن اللعبة في وضع الإقران/البحث. ستتفاعل كل الألعاب ضمن النطاق في الوقت نفسه."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Les jouets Love Spouse 2.4g utilisent les annonces BLE. Vérifiez que le Bluetooth est activé et que le jouet est en mode appairage/recherche. Tous les jouets à portée réagiront simultanément."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Zabawki Love Spouse 2.4g używają rozgłaszania BLE. Upewnij się, że Bluetooth jest włączony, a zabawka jest w trybie parowania/skanowania. Obie zabawki w zasięgu zareagują jednocześnie."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Love-Spouse-2.4g-Toys nutzen BLE-Advertising. Stelle sicher, dass Bluetooth aktiv ist und das Toy im Kopplungs-/Suchmodus ist. Alle Toys in Reichweite reagieren gleichzeitig."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Brinquedos Love Spouse 2.4g usam anúncios BLE. Verifique se o Bluetooth está ativado e se o brinquedo está em modo de pareamento/busca. Todos os brinquedos ao alcance reagirão ao mesmo tempo."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Los juguetes Love Spouse de 2,4 GHz usan anuncios BLE. Asegúrate de que el Bluetooth esté activado y de que el juguete esté en modo de emparejamiento/búsqueda. Todos los juguetes al alcance reaccionarán a la vez."}}}},"hint_match_and_rateme_are_part":{"localizations":{"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Match och RateMe ingår i stashy+."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Match og RateMe er en del af stashy+."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Match e RateMe fanno parte di stashy+."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Match وRateMe جزء من stashy+."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Match og RateMe er en del av stashy+."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Match и RateMe входят в stashy+."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Match et RateMe font partie de stashy+."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Match i RateMe są częścią stashy+."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Match und RateMe sind Teil von stashy+."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Match en RateMe maken deel uit van stashy+."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Match 및 RateMe는 stashy+의 일부입니다."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Match and RateMe are part of stashy+."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Match e RateMe fazem parte do stashy+."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"MatchとRateMeはstashy+の機能です。"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Match y RateMe forman parte de stashy+."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Match ve RateMe stashy+'nın parçasıdır."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Match 和 RateMe 是 stashy+ 的一部分。"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Match 和 RateMe 属于 stashy+。"}}}},"hint_matches_performer_studio_and_tag":{"localizations":{"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"將演員、工作室和標籤名稱與檔案路徑比對，並加入短片、圖片和圖庫。較短的名稱可能會誤判。"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Oyuncu, stüdyo ve etiket adlarını dosya yollarıyla eşleştirir ve bunları sahnelere, resimlere ve galerilere ekler. Kısa adlar yanlışlıkla eşleşebilir."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Matchar namn på stjärnor, studior och taggar mot filsökvägar och lägger till dem i scener, bilder och gallerier. Korta namn kan ge felaktiga träffar."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"将演员、工作室和标签名称与文件路径进行匹配，并将其添加到短片、图片和图库。较短的名称可能会误匹配。"}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Sammenligner utøver-, studio- og taggnavn med filstier og legger dem til scener, bilder og gallerier. Korte navn kan gi feil treff."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Сопоставляет имена исполнителей, студий и тегов с путями файлов и добавляет их к сценам, изображениям и галереям. Короткие имена могут совпасть ошибочно."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Confronta i nomi di performer, studi e tag con i percorsi dei file e li aggiunge a scene, immagini e gallerie. I nomi brevi possono corrispondere per errore."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Compara los nombres de intérpretes, estudios y etiquetas con las rutas de archivo y los añade a escenas, imágenes y galerías. Los nombres cortos pueden coincidir por error."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Matcher kunstner-, studie- og tagnavne med filstier og føjer dem til scener, billeder og gallerier. Korte navne kan matche ved en fejl."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Gleicht Darsteller-, Studio- und Tag-Namen mit Dateipfaden ab und fügt sie Szenen, Bildern und Galerien hinzu. Kurze Namen können versehentlich passen."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Compara nomes de artistas, estúdios e etiquetas com os caminhos dos arquivos e os adiciona a cenas, imagens e galerias. Nomes curtos podem corresponder por engano."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"배우, 스튜디오 및 태그 이름을 파일 경로와 대조하여 영상, 이미지 및 갤러리에 추가합니다. 짧은 이름은 잘못 일치할 수 있습니다."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"出演者、スタジオ、タグの名前をファイルパスと照合し、シーン、画像、ギャラリーに追加します。短い名前は誤って一致することがあります。"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"يطابق أسماء المؤدين والاستوديوهات والوسوم مع مسارات الملفات ويضيفها إلى المشاهد والصور والمعارض. قد تتطابق الأسماء القصيرة عن طريق الخطأ."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Vergelijkt namen van performers, studio's en labels met bestandspaden en voegt ze toe aan scènes, afbeeldingen en galerijen. Korte namen kunnen per ongeluk overeenkomen."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Matches performer, studio and tag names against file paths and adds them to scenes, images and galleries. Short names can match by mistake."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Dopasowuje nazwy aktorów, studiów i tagów do ścieżek plików i dodaje je do scen, obrazów i galerii. Krótkie nazwy mogą dopasować się przez pomyłkę."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Compare les noms de performeurs, studios et étiquettes aux chemins de fichiers et les ajoute aux scènes, images et galeries. Les noms courts peuvent correspondre par erreur."}}}},"hint_matches_when_at_least_one":{"localizations":{"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Corresponde quando pelo menos uma condição abaixo é verdadeira."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Samsvarer når minst én betingelse nedenfor er oppfylt."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Komt overeen als aan minstens één voorwaarde hieronder is voldaan."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Совпадает, если выполняется хотя бы одно условие ниже."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Corrisponde quando almeno una delle condizioni qui sotto è vera."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Correspond si au moins une condition ci-dessous est remplie."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Trifft zu, wenn mindestens eine Bedingung unten erfüllt ist."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"يتطابق عندما يتحقق شرط واحد على الأقل مما يلي."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Pasuje, gdy co najmniej jeden z poniższych warunków jest spełniony."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"下の条件のうち少なくとも1つが真の場合に一致します。"}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Matcher, når mindst én betingelse nedenfor er opfyldt."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Coincide cuando se cumple al menos una de las condiciones de abajo."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Matches when at least one condition below is true."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Matchar när minst ett villkor nedan är uppfyllt."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"아래 조건 중 하나 이상이 충족되면 일치합니다."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"下方至少有一个条件成立时即匹配。"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Aşağıdaki koşullardan en az biri sağlandığında eşleşir."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"只要符合下方至少一個條件即算相符。"}}}},"hint_mini_player_arg_opens_player":{"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"迷你播放器：%@。打开播放器"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"迷你播放器：%@。打開播放器"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Mini oynatıcı: %@. Oynatıcıyı açar"}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Miniafspiller: %@. Åbner afspilleren"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Мини-плеер: %@. Открывает плеер"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Miniplayer: %@. Öffnet den Player"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"미니 플레이어: %@. 플레이어를 엽니다"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Minispeler: %@. Opent de speler"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Minirreproductor: %@. Abre el reproductor"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Mini player: %@. Opens the player"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Miniodtwarzacz: %@. Otwiera odtwarzacz"}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Minispiller: %@. Åpner spilleren"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Mini-lecteur : %@. Ouvre le lecteur"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"ミニプレーヤー：%@。プレーヤーを開きます"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"المشغّل المصغّر: %@. يفتح المشغّل"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Minispelare: %@. Öppnar spelaren"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Mini player: %@. Apre il player"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Miniplayer: %@. Abre o player"}}}},"hint_missing_from_store_offering_arg":{"localizations":{"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"غير موجود في عرض المتجر: %@"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Falta en la oferta de la tienda: %@"}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Mangler i butikkens udbud: %@"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Отсутствует в предложении магазина: %@"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ausente da oferta da loja: %@"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Missing from the store offering: %@"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Mancanti nell'offerta dello store: %@"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"스토어 상품에 없음: %@"}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Mangler i butikktilbudet: %@"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Brak w ofercie sklepu: %@"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"ストアのオファリングにありません：%@"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Absent de l'offre de la boutique : %@"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ontbreekt in het winkelaanbod: %@"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Fehlt im Store-Angebot: %@"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Saknas i butikens utbud: %@"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"商店产品中缺少：%@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"商店方案中缺少：%@"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Mağaza teklifinde eksik: %@"}}}},"hint_monthly_yearly_or_lifetime_bought":{"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"按月、按年或终身。之前曾用此 Google 帐户购买过 stashy+ 或重新安装了 App？请轻点“恢复购买”。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"月訂、年訂或終身版。之前曾以此 Google 帳號購買 stashy+，或重新安裝了 App？請點「恢復購買項目」。"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Aylık, Yıllık veya Ömür Boyu. stashy+'yı daha önce bu Google hesabıyla mı aldın ya da yeniden mi yükledin? Satın Alınanları Geri Yükle'ye dokun."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"月額、年額、または買い切り。このGoogleアカウントで以前stashy+を購入した場合や再インストールした場合は、「購入を復元」をタップしてください。"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Månad, år eller livstid. Har du köpt stashy+ tidigare med det här Google-kontot eller installerat om? Tryck på Återställ köp."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Månedlig, årlig eller livstid. Har du købt stashy+ før med denne Google-konto eller geninstalleret? Tryk på Gendan køb."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Mensuel, annuel ou à vie. Vous avez déjà acheté stashy+ avec ce compte Google ou réinstallé l'app ? Touchez Restaurer les achats."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"월간, 연간 또는 평생 이용권. 이전에 이 Google 계정으로 stashy+를 구입했거나 다시 설치했습니까? 구입 항목 복원을 탭하세요."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Maandelijks, jaarlijks of levenslang. Eerder stashy+ gekocht met dit Google-account of opnieuw geïnstalleerd? Tik op 'Herstel aankopen'."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"شهري أو سنوي أو دائم. هل اشتريت stashy+ سابقًا بحساب Google هذا، أو أعدت التثبيت؟ اضغط على «استعادة المشتريات»."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Miesięcznie, rocznie lub dożywotnio. Kupiłeś już stashy+ na tym koncie Google lub zainstalowałeś ponownie? Stuknij Odtwórz zakupy."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Monthly, Yearly, or Lifetime. Bought stashy+ before with this Google account, or reinstalled? Tap Restore Purchases."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Månedlig, årlig eller livstid. Har du kjøpt stashy+ før med denne Google-kontoen, eller installert på nytt? Trykk på Gjenopprett kjøp."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Mensal, anual ou vitalício. Já comprou o stashy+ com esta conta Google ou reinstalou o app? Toque em Restaurar compras."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Mensual, anual o de por vida. ¿Ya compraste stashy+ con esta cuenta de Google o reinstalaste la app? Toca Restaurar compras."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Месяц, год или навсегда. Уже покупали stashy+ с этим аккаунтом Google или переустановили приложение? Нажмите «Восстановить покупки»."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Mensile, annuale o Lifetime. Hai già acquistato stashy+ con questo account Google o hai reinstallato l'app? Tocca Ripristina acquisti."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Monatlich, jährlich oder lebenslang. stashy+ schon mit diesem Google-Konto gekauft oder neu installiert? Tippe auf „Käufe wiederherstellen“."}}}},"hint_monthly_yearly_or_lifetime_if":{"localizations":{"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Mensual, anual o de por vida. Si compraste stashy como app de pago antes de la 3.0 o acabas de pasar desde TestFlight, toca Restaurar compras."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Månedlig, årlig eller livstid. Hvis du kjøpte stashy som betalt app før 3.0, eller nettopp har gått over fra TestFlight, trykker du på Gjenopprett kjøp."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"월간, 연간 또는 평생 이용권. 3.0 이전에 stashy를 유료 앱으로 구입했거나 TestFlight에서 막 전환했다면 구입 항목 복원을 탭하세요."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Mensuel, annuel ou à vie. Si vous avez acheté stashy comme app payante avant la 3.0, ou venez de quitter TestFlight, touchez Restaurer les achats."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Monthly, Yearly, or Lifetime. If you bought stashy as a paid app before 3.0, or just switched from TestFlight, tap Restore Purchases."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Maandelijks, jaarlijks of levenslang. Heb je stashy vóór 3.0 als betaalde app gekocht, of ben je net overgestapt van TestFlight, tik dan op 'Herstel aankopen'."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Mensal, anual ou vitalício. Se você comprou o stashy como 