dor y sus valoraciones se actualizan en tu servidor."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Puts performers against each other under Discover. You pick the winner and their ratings update on your server."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"「見つける」で出演者同士を対戦させます。勝者を選ぶと、サーバー上の評価が更新されます。"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"يضع المؤدين في مواجهة بعضهم ضمن «استكشاف». تختار الفائز ويتم تحديث تقييماتهم على الخادم."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"둘러보기에서 배우끼리 대결시킵니다. 승자를 고르면 서버의 별점이 업데이트됩니다."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Mette i performer uno contro l'altro in Scopri. Scegli tu il vincitore e le loro valutazioni vengono aggiornate sul server."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"在「探索」中讓演員互相對決。由你選出勝者，其評分會在你的伺服器上更新。"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"在“发现”中让演员两两对决。你选出胜者，其评分会在你的服务器上更新。"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ställer stjärnor mot varandra under Upptäck. Du väljer vinnaren och deras betyg uppdateras på servern."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Keşfet altında oyuncuları karşı karşıya getirir. Kazananı sen seçersin ve puanları sunucunda güncellenir."}}}},"hint_ranks_your_top_scenes_performers":{"localizations":{"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"在「工具」中依 O 計數或評分等指標，為你最常看的短片、演員、工作室和標籤排名。"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"在“工具”中按 O 计数或评分等指标为你的热门短片、演员、工作室和标签排名。"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Araçlar'da en iyi sahnelerini, oyuncularını, stüdyolarını ve etiketlerini O Sayısı veya puan gibi ölçülere göre sıralar."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Rangordnar dina främsta scener, stjärnor, studior och taggar i Verktyg, efter mått som O-räknare eller betyg."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Oカウントや評価などの指標で、トップのシーン、出演者、スタジオ、タグをツールでランキング表示します。"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"يرتّب أفضل مشاهدك ومؤديك واستوديوهاتك ووسومك في الأدوات، وفق مقاييس مثل عدّاد O أو التقييم."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Classifica le tue scene, performer, studi e tag migliori in Strumenti, per criteri come contatore O o valutazione."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Tworzy w Narzędziach rankingi Twoich najlepszych scen, aktorów, studiów i tagów według miar takich jak licznik O czy ocena."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Classifica suas principais cenas, artistas, estúdios e etiquetas em Ferramentas, por critérios como contagem O ou avaliação."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Rangerer dine topscener, -kunstnere, -studier og -tags i Værktøjer efter mål som O-tæller eller bedømmelse."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"도구에서 O 카운트나 별점 등의 기준으로 상위 영상, 배우, 스튜디오 및 태그의 순위를 매깁니다."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Clasifica tus escenas, intérpretes, estudios y etiquetas favoritos en Herramientas según medidas como el contador O o la valoración."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Rangerer de beste scenene, utøverne, studioene og taggene dine i Verktøy, etter mål som O-teller eller vurdering."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ranks your top scenes, performers, studios and tags in Tools, by measures like O Count or rating."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Rangschikt je topscènes, -performers, -studio's en -labels in Tools, op maatstaven zoals O-teller of beoordeling."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Rankt deine Top-Szenen, -Darsteller, -Studios und -Tags in Werkzeuge, nach Maßen wie O-Zähler oder Bewertung."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Составляет в «Инструментах» рейтинги ваших лучших сцен, исполнителей, студий и тегов — по счетчику O, рейтингу и другим показателям."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Classe vos meilleurs scènes, performeurs, studios et étiquettes dans Outils, selon des critères comme le compteur O ou la note."}}}},"hint_ratings_that_were_not_saved":{"localizations":{"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Les notes non enregistrées sont perdues."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"저장되지 않은 별점은 사라집니다."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"保存されていない評価は失われます。"}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Bedømmelser, der ikke blev gemt, går tabt."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Avaliações que não foram salvas serão perdidas."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Niezapisane oceny zostaną utracone."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Vurderinger som ikke ble lagret, går tapt."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Несохраненные рейтинги будут потеряны."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"ستُفقد التقييمات التي لم يتم حفظها."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Las valoraciones que no se guardaron se pierden."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Le valutazioni non salvate andranno perse."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Beoordelingen die niet zijn bewaard, gaan verloren."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Nicht gespeicherte Bewertungen gehen verloren."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ratings that were not saved are lost."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Betyg som inte sparades går förlorade."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"未存储的评分将会丢失。"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Kaydedilmeyen puanlar kaybolur."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"未儲存的評分將會遺失。"}}}},"hint_remove_arg_from_stash_other":{"localizations":{"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"要從 Stash 移除「%@」嗎？其他裝置將失去此已儲存的篩選條件。"}},"tr":{"stringUni