s, O Counts and ratings."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"재생, O 카운트 및 별점을 바탕으로 선택한 영상입니다."}}}},"hint_scenes_played_in_this_period":{"localizations":{"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"이 기간에 재생한 영상은 제안되지 않습니다."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Sceny odtwarzane w tym okresie nie są proponowane."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Scenes played in this period are not suggested."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Les scènes lues pendant cette période ne sont pas suggérées."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Scener, der er afspillet i denne periode, foreslås ikke."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"No se sugieren las escenas reproducidas en este periodo."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Сцены, воспроизведенные в этот период, не предлагаются."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Le scene riprodotte in questo periodo non vengono suggerite."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"In diesem Zeitraum gespielte Szenen werden nicht vorgeschlagen."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Scener som er spilt i denne perioden, blir ikke foreslått."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"この期間に再生したシーンは提案されません。"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Scènes die in deze periode zijn afgespeeld, worden niet voorgesteld."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Cenas reproduzidas neste período não são sugeridas."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"لا تُقترح المشاهد التي تم تشغيلها في هذه الفترة."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"在此期間播放過的短片不會被推薦。"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Scener som spelats under den här perioden föreslås inte."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"在此期间播放过的短片不会被推荐。"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Bu döne