افة إلى شروط stashy الخاصة."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy bruger komponenterne ovenfor. Deres licenser gælder ud over stashys egne vilkår."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy использует перечисленные выше компоненты. Их лицензии действуют в дополнение к условиям stashy."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy usa i componenti qui sopra. Le loro licenze si applicano in aggiunta ai termini di stashy."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"O stashy usa os componentes acima. As licenças deles se aplicam além dos termos do próprio stashy."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy는 위의 구성 요소를 사용합니다. 해당 라이선스는 stashy 자체 약관에 추가로 적용됩니다."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy uses the components above. Their licenses apply in addition to stashy's own terms."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy bruker komponentene ovenfor. Lisensene deres gjelder i tillegg til stashys egne vilkår."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashyは上記のコンポーネントを使用しています。それらのライセンスはstashy自体の規約に加えて適用されます。"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy nutzt die oben genannten Komponenten. Ihre Lizenzen gelten zusätzlich zu stashys eigenen Bedingungen."}}}},"hint_subscribe_or_buy_lifetime_to":{"localizations":{"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"اشترك أو اشترِ الاشتراك الدائم لفتح الميزات المميزة."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Abonnez-vous ou achetez l'accès à vie pour débloquer les fonctions premium."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Abonner eller kjøp livstid for å låse opp premiumfunksjoner."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Assine ou compre o vitalício para desbloquear recursos premium."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Abonner, eller køb livstid for at låse premiumfunktioner op."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"s