aj więcej podobnych."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Se noen scener, så foreslår stashy flere lignende her."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Schau ein paar Szenen, dann schlägt stashy hier ähnliche vor."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"영상을 몇 개 시청하면 stashy가 비슷한 영상을 여기에 제안합니다."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Посмотрите несколько сцен, и stashy предложит здесь похожие."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"观看几个短片，stashy 就会在这里推荐更多类似的内容。"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Birkaç sahne izle, stashy burada onlara benzer sahneler önersin."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"觀看幾部短片後，stashy 會在這裡推薦類似的內容。"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Titta på några scener så föreslår stashy fler liknande här."}}}},"hint_were_checking_if_your_server":{"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"我们正在检查你的服务器是否可访问"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"正在檢查是否能連上你的伺服器"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Sunucuna ulaşılıp ulaşılamadığını denetliyoruz"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Vi kontrollerar om din server kan nås"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"We controleren of je server bereikbaar is"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"サーバーに接続できるか確認しています"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"We're checking if your server is reachable"}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Vi tjekker, om din server kan nås"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wir prüfen, ob dein Server erreichbar ist"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Estamos comprobando si se puede acceder a tu servidor"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"نتحقق مما إذا كان الخادم متاحًا"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stiamo verificando se il tuo server è raggiungibile"}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Vi sjekker om serveren din kan nås"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"서버에 연결할 수 있는지 확인하는 중입니다"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Estamos verificando se seu servidor está acessível"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Nous vérifions si votre serveur est joignable"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Проверяем доступность вашего сервера"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Sprawdzamy, czy serwer jest osiągalny"}}}},"hint_with_api_keys_file_gives":{"localizations":{"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"С ключами API файл дает полный доступ к вашим серверам. Не передавайте его другим."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"APIキーを含むファイルは、サーバーへのフルアクセスを与えます。他人と共有しないでください。"}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Med API-nøgler giver filen fuld adgang til dine servere. Hold den privat."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Z kluczami API plik daje pełny dostęp do Twoich serwerów. Nie udostępniaj go."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"API 키가 포함된 파일은 서버에 대한 전체 접근 권한을 부여합니다. 비공개로 보관하세요."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"With API keys the file gives full access to your servers. Keep it private."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Con le chiavi API il file dà accesso completo ai tuoi server. Tienilo privato."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Med API-nøkler gir filen full tilgang til serverne dine. Hold den privat."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"مع مفاتيح API يمنح الملف وصولًا كاملًا إلى خوادمك. احتفظ به خاصًا."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Con las claves de API, el archivo da acceso completo a tus servidores. Mantenlo en privado."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Avec les clés API, le fichier donne un accès complet à vos serveurs. Gardez-le privé."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Com chaves de API, o arquivo dá acesso total aos seus servidores. Mantenha-o privado."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Mit API-Schlüsseln gibt die Datei vollen Zugriff auf deine Server. Halte sie privat."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Met API-sleutels geeft het bestand volledige toegang tot je servers. Houd het privé."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"API anahtarlarıyla birlikte dosya sunucularına tam erişim verir. Gizli tut."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"包含 API 金鑰時，此檔案可完整存取你的伺服器。請妥善保管。"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"包含 API 密钥时，此文件可完全访问你的服务器。请妥善保管。"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Med API-nycklar ger filen full åtkomst till dina servrar. Håll den privat."}}}},"hint_you_bought_stashy_before_it":{"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"你在 stashy 改为订阅制之前就已购买，因此 stashy+ 永久归你所有。此后 App 已大幅成长。如果你愿意支持它的开发，打赏是一份心意，完全自愿。"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Du köpte stashy innan appen gick över till prenumerationer, så stashy+ är ditt för alltid. Sedan dess har appen vuxit enormt. Om du vill stödja utvecklingen är dricks en vänlig gest, helt frivillig."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy'yi aboneliğe geçmeden önce satın aldın, bu yüzden stashy+ ömür boyu senin. O zamandan beri uygulama çok büyüdü. Gelişimini desteklemek istersen bir bahşiş güzel bir jest olur, tamamen isteğe bağlı."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"你在 stashy 改為訂閱制之前就已購買，因此 stashy+ 將終身屬於你。自那時起，App 已大幅成長。如果你想支持它的開發，給點小費是一份心意，完全自由選擇。"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Kupiłeś stashy, zanim przeszło na subskrypcje, więc stashy+ jest Twoje dożywotnio. Od tego czasu aplikacja bardzo się rozrosła. Jeśli chcesz wesprzeć jej rozwój, napiwek będzie miłym gestem — całkowicie opcjonalnym."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Você comprou o stashy antes de ele passar para assinaturas, então o stashy+ é seu para sempre. Desde então, o app cresceu muito. Se quiser apoiar o desenvolvimento, uma gorjeta é um gesto gentil, totalmente opcional."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Compraste stashy antes de que pasara a suscripciones, así que stashy+ es tuyo de por vida. Desde entonces la app ha crecido muchísimo. Si quieres apoyar su desarrollo, una propina es un bonito gesto, totalmente opcional."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Du købte stashy, før appen gik over til abonnementer, så stashy+ er din for livet. Siden da er appen vokset enormt. Hvis du vil støtte udviklingen, er drikkepenge en venlig gestus – helt valgfrit."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"You bought stashy before it moved to subscriptions, so stashy+ stays yours for life. Since then the app has grown massively. If you'd like to support its development, a tip is a kind gesture, entirely optional."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Вы купили stashy до перехода на подписки, поэтому stashy+ остается вашим навсегда. С тех пор приложение сильно выросло. Если хотите поддержать разработку, чаевые будут приятным, но совершенно необязательным жестом."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Je hebt stashy gekocht voordat het overstapte op abonnementen, dus stashy+ blijft levenslang van jou. Sindsdien is de app enorm gegroeid. Wil je de ontwikkeling steunen, dan is een fooi een vriendelijk gebaar, geheel vrijblijvend."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"لقد اشتريت stashy قبل انتقاله إلى الاشتراكات، لذا يبقى stashy+ لك مدى الحياة. منذ ذلك الحين نما التطبيق كثيرًا. إذا رغبت في دعم تطويره، فالإكرامية لفتة لطيفة واختيارية تمامًا."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"サブスクリプション制に移行する前にstashyを購入されたため、stashy+はずっとご利用いただけます。それ以降、アプリは大きく成長しました。開発を応援していただける場合は、チップをいただけると嬉しいです（まったくの任意です）。"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Du hast stashy vor der Umstellung auf Abos gekauft, daher bleibt stashy+ für immer deins. Seitdem ist die App enorm gewachsen. Wenn du die Entwicklung unterstützen möchtest, ist ein Trinkgeld eine nette Geste – ganz freiwillig."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Hai acquistato stashy prima del passaggio agli abbonamenti, quindi stashy+ resta tuo per sempre. Da allora l'app è cresciuta enormemente. Se vuoi sostenerne lo sviluppo, una mancia è un bel gesto, del tutto facoltativo."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"구독제로 전환되기 전에 stashy를 구입하셨기 때문에 stashy+를 평생 사용할 수 있습니다. 그 이후로 앱이 크게 성장했습니다. 개발을 후원하고 싶다면 팁을 보내 주시면 감사하겠습니다. 전적으로 선택 사항입니다."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Vous avez acheté stashy avant le passage aux abonnements, stashy+ vous reste donc acquis à vie. Depuis, l'app s'est énormément enrichie. Si vous souhaitez soutenir son développement, un pourboire est un geste apprécié, entièrement facultatif."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Du kjøpte stashy før appen gikk over til abonnement, så stashy+ er ditt for alltid. Siden den gang har appen vokst enormt. Hvis du vil støtte utviklingen, er et tips en hyggelig gest – helt valgfritt."}}}},"hint_your_api_key_is_invalid":{"localizations":{"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"مفتاح API غير صالح أو منتهي الصلاحية. يُرجى التحقق من تكوين الخادم."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Twój klucz API jest nieprawidłowy lub wygasł. Sprawdź konfigurację serwera."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"APIキーが無効か、期限切れです。サーバー設定を確認してください。"}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"API-nøkkelen din er ugyldig eller utløpt. Sjekk serverkonfigurasjonen."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Dein API-Schlüssel ist ungültig oder abgelaufen. Prüfe de